<title>UK: XEROX CREDIT CORP SETS $147.6 MLN THREE-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>XEROX CREDIT CORP SETS $147.6 MLN THREE-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Kokusai and Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   XEROX CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $147.6 MLN    COUPON     5.4	 MATURITY    11.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    11.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.5	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A	DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
